Design a 3-to-8 priority decoder that generates a unique output line for each combination of the 3 input signals. The output is an active high signal corresponding to the binary value of the input, with the output lines being set from `out[0]` for `in=3'b000` to `out[7]` for `in=3'b111`. If an invalid input is received, all outputs are set to low.
